
# Other root-level ignore rules
# ...
node_modules/
dist/
.idea/
**/.idea/
debug/
target/
**/target
Cargo.lock
**/Cargo.lock
!Cargo.lock

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# These are files generated when runing code coverage
**/*.profraw
**/*.profdata

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

**/.DS_Store
.DS_Store
*.env
risk-source_*/

# MacOS Metadata File suffix
._*